      "content": "thanks for the advice. i have some peroxide and iodine here so i'll try that. i'm also pretty sure i'm overdue for a tetanus shot though... i think it's been like 10 years? would the peroxide and iodine be enough to kill anything like tetanus so i can just skip the clinic and get back to work? i really dont want to deal with the cost and the wait time if i dont have to.",
